{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Rekindled Edition of the acclaimed adventure featuring improved visual fidelity powered by Unreal Engine 5!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Owners of the original game will receive the Rekindled Edition for free! </strong><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Lost Ember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breathtakingly beautiful world holds the secrets of its past for you and your companion to uncover in this 5-hour journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/57055a9b600cd21365c50b6eae8d1ed3.poster.avif?t=1764284660\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/57055a9b600cd21365c50b6eae8d1ed3.webm?t=1764284660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/57055a9b600cd21365c50b6eae8d1ed3.mp4?t=1764284660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the contrasting stories of the fall of mankind and the lush life in a world reclaimed by nature with a wolf as your main character and a determined companion at your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/b0389ad3e86d93fca0da61551c300aab.poster.avif?t=1764284660\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/b0389ad3e86d93fca0da61551c300aab.webm?t=1764284660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/b0389ad3e86d93fca0da61551c300aab.mp4?t=1764284660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the land, sea, and air, as you possess any creature you come across to experience life from a whole new perspective. Fly through gargantuan canyon valleys as a parrot! Tumble through the grass as a wombat! Swim through shimmering lakes as a fish! Your journey will take you from densely wooded jungles, to lush rainforest canopies, to barren desert plains and archaic temples. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/cfe3de674eb9bdf86cf97df0607044bc.avif?t=1764284660\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you'll discover a tale of loyalty, despair, and betrayal, as echoes of the lost Yanrana culture come to life in a lush wilderness devoid of man.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're Breathtaking!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3086580/58e7c77f3024ee868040f0dee3d90842502e9a6d.jpg"},{"name":"The World is my Zoo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3086580/cf388e61921fb591c7547d8a38bee3284b9119a2.jpg"},{"name":"Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3086580/2a1e7b1d494f2194a0bbb78887aa9ff43f685bfc.jpg"},{"name":"I Need More Colors!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3086580/12ba4059f7897a7b29d2bb43ddc722028a45b98b.jpg"},{"name":"Landscaping Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3086580/1ee05a77a5539fe9bbc32259e3031463e7a83544.jpg"},{"name":"That's a Pretty Garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3086580/a795a549d20d065b2bafaa0ea62f31345867e367.jpg"},{"name":"Landscaping Starlet","path":"http