ross to experience life from a whole new perspective. Fly through gargantuan canyon valleys as a parrot! Tumble through the grass as a wombat! Swim through shimmering lakes as a fish! Your journey will take you from densely wooded jungles, to lush rainforest canopies, to barren desert plains and archaic temples. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/cfe3de674eb9bdf86cf97df0607044bc.avif?t=1764284660\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you'll discover a tale of loyalty, despair, and betrayal, as echoes of the lost Yanrana culture come to life in a lush wilderness devoid of man.</p>","developers":["Mooneye Studios"],"dlc":[4075340],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/c9143b74bd945ebd052cafa8fb3c3e45ff1f3478/header.jpg?t=1764284660","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3086580/7660646/a3a20578d7c3d1175ed63436ca42e32caeb6d596/1764281225/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764284658","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3086580/7660646/a3a20578d7c3d1175ed63436ca42e32caeb6d596/1764281225/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764284658","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3086580/7660646/a3a20578d7c3d1175ed63436ca42e32caeb6d596/1764281225/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764284658","id":257239560,"name":"Lost Ember: Rekindled Edition - Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257239560/2674f4823c160ddb8a1f3592d81b9a68f15f96de/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764284658"}],"name":"LOST EMBER: Rekindled Edition","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"defau